# PhishProof SIH

- Product spec: `PHISHPROOF_COMPLETE_FINAL.md`. Operating plan: `PHISHPROOF_SIH_PLAN.md`.
- Extend this repo only. Do not start a second FastAPI/milter/dashboard.
- Fusion = evidence consistency / variance. Never “94% probability malicious.” Origin = probable originating infrastructure, never attacker city/IP.
- Device-code / TOAD = heuristics. OAuth / AiTM = mock, do not pitch as live.
